                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It causes my physical pain to hit the \"NO\" button.\n\nThere is so much good in this game. Great graphics, presentation is par-excellence, sounds, concept, animations... everything except the gameplay... it's just way too flat.\n\nChoices for upgrades are limited and of little use... I want to love this game and you can see from my play time I've given it a good shot. But I find myself becoming bored as I play. What a shame.\n\nIf you're super-curious, get it on sale, but the underlying gameplay is pretty thin. I hate to say it.",
